      <p class="related-resources-title">Additional resources</p>
      <ul>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/nodes/pods/nodes-pods-secrets#nodes-pods-secrets-about_nodes-pods-secrets">Understanding secrets</a></li>
